<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls to 6.87 pct at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls to 6.87 pct at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 3.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.45 percent.</p>
<p>		   May 1, 2004 CCT		Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.00 pct		6.28 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 6.87 pct		7.19 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price   99.20		   99.05</p>
<p>    Total bids	 10.321 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    3.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on April 29.</p>
</text>
